"to view or edit any images in Raw file formats. Please check %6 installation on "
"your computer."
"<p>Note: at least, dcraw version %7 is required by %8</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Dat Programm <b>%1</b> is nich op den niegsten Stand:"
